OL,5,G0105 Ice Road Truckers
OL,6,     FDramatic documentary series. The
OL,7,     Ftruckers in the historic
OL,8,     Ffour-truck convoy face fire and a
OL,9,     Fthin crossing.
OL,10,G0205 Trucking Hell
OL,11,     FAdam is forced to deal with a
OL,12,     F26-tonne bin lorry that has fallen
OL,13,     Fonto its side; Lee comes up with a
OL,14,     Fclever plan to pull a 44-tonne
OL,15,     Fmeat lorry out of a ditch.
OL,16,G0305 Trucking Hell
OL,17,     FThe men and women working in the
OL,18,     Fheavy recovery business are
OL,19,     Ffollowed, as they tackle
OL,20,     Fjack-knifed lorries, crashed heavy
OL,21,     Fgoods vehicles and roadside
OL,22,     Fbreakdowns.
